disa-stig:Samsung_SDS_EMM_STIG:SV-225645r588007_rule The Samsung SDS EMM must be configured with a periodicity for reachable events of six hours or less for the following commands to the agent: 
- query connectivity status;
- query the current version of the MD firmware/software;
- query the current version of installed mobile applications;
- read audit logs kept by the MD.

